; Umbra: stalker squads of every faction can go into the Zone's labs and underground levels, so
; you can run into them down there. Anomaly opens most of these smarts to squads only after the
; player's own story progress (and mostly to Loners only); here most are open from the start, and
; the ones that hold a story scene open once that scene is over:
; - X-18's scripted rooms (dar_poltergeist_*) once their story poltergeists are dead: the ring
;   room after its two waves (they start at the first code lock); the two teleport rooms have
;   story poltergeists only in survival mode, so in other games they're open from the start.
;   Its military scout smart once that squad is killed.
; - X-10 and X-16 once their psi source is off; Warlab once its generators are off (all of them
;   from the start of a game without the story).
; - The story bandits' and soldiers' own smarts in Agroprom Underground, as before, once those
;   squads are dead.
; Story squads keep their scripted jobs (exclusive, by squad or NPC name): visitors can't take
; them. Population caps are G.A.M.M.A.'s (2 or more) or raised to 2 next to the smart's config.

